# iCloud/Finder conflict-copy pattern. NARROW on purpose: only "<name> 2.<ext>" /
# "<name> 3.<ext>" siblings, never a legitimate file. Re-check `git status` after edits.
* 2.py
* 3.py
* 2.ts
* 3.ts
* 2.tsx
* 3.tsx

